  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 37 plugins and 730 stars, alongside the dsh 0.1.6-alpha.2 release; desktop projects led growth, with dataelement/dsh-desktop up 236 stars. However, 12,161 of 15,533 tracked plugins have been stale for 7+ days and the health score sits at 38, so activity concentration is worth watching.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>37</b> 个插件，官方仓库涨 <b>730</b> 星，并发布 dsh <b>0.1.6-alpha.2</b>；桌面端仍是热度中心，dataelement/dsh-desktop 单日 +<b>236</b> 星领跑。不过 <b>15533</b> 个受追踪插件里有 <b>12161</b> 个已 7 天未更新，健康分仅 <b>38</b>，建议持续观察活跃度分化。"
